            "review_title": "Review at Nikura - Contemporary Nikkei Cuisine",
            "review_text": "will h\nSan Jose, California41 contributions\n0\nA Great Restaurant Nikura, Beautiful as well!\nMay 2026 • Couples\nHello,\n My wife and I are from the USA, we were looking for a great restaurant and found Nikura Restaurant, they have only been opened about a month or so, we were amazed by the beauty of the restaurant inside and outdoors. \n The atmosphere is beautiful and there is plenty of seating inside as well as outdoors. It is very romantic as well.\n The staff were all great and the Chef really is outstanding. I had the Wagu Steak with a couple sides that come with it and it was excellent, my wife had Salmon with a side which she loved.\n We highly recommend this restaurant to you if you want great food and a beautiful spot to go to.\n Thank you to everyone there for an awesome experience.\nRead more\nWritten May 2, 2026",
